-- rule_llm.rfn -- a model proposes to loosen the norm: a deposit of nothing would pass. A rule
-- is a policy point floored trusted (Art. 4 keeps llm off it at the declaring altitude), so the
-- court refuses the proposal at the trust stage, Art. 6 named.
DEFINE REFINE loosen_the_norm AS (
  TARGET "positive_deposit.RULE", KIND policy,
  FROM "amount > 0", TO "amount >= 0",
  AUTHOR "aicha", POSTURE llm,
  REASON "a zero deposit keeps a member's place in the round"
) RATIONALE "A rule means one thing everywhere, and no model rewrites it"
